## Coding Agent Responsibilities

The Coding Agent receives a task like:

> "Optimize this Next.js project for SEO."

Its workflow should be:

```text
Receive Task
      │
      ▼
Understand Repository
      │
      ▼
Identify Relevant Files
      │
      ▼
Ask Knowledge Base for SEO Rules
      │
      ▼
Generate Implementation Plan
      │
      ▼
Modify Code
      │
      ▼
Run Local Verification
      │
      ▼
Send to Verification Agent
```

The Coding Agent is responsible for implementing **everything that can be expressed as code**.

For example:

### Metadata

* Title tags
* Meta descriptions
* Open Graph
* Twitter Cards

### Technical SEO

* robots.txt
* sitemap.xml
* Canonical tags
* hreflang
* Redirects
* Structured data (JSON-LD)

### Performance

* Lazy loading
* Image optimization
* Core Web Vitals improvements
* Script optimization

### Accessibility (SEO-related)

* Alt text
* Heading hierarchy
* Semantic HTML

### Framework-specific improvements

* Next.js metadata API
* SSR/SSG configuration
* Dynamic sitemap generation
* Route optimization

### AI Search readiness

* llms.txt
* AEO structure
* GEO recommendations
* Internal linking improvements

